        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Monteiro Fabrics Takes the Stage at PVC 2025",
        "title_size": 36,
        "title_width": 40,
        "heading_h1": false,
        "text": "<p>Monteiro Fabrics proudly participated in the <a href=\"https://avlantegroup.com/4th-annual-future-of-pvc-compounding-production-amp-recycling-forum-hybrid-event/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://avlantegroup.com/4th-annual-future-of-pvc-compounding-production-amp-recycling-forum-hybrid-event/\"><strong>4th Annual Future of PVC 2025 Conference</strong></a> held in Brussels on March 13th–14th, where our R&D and Technical Manager, <strong>Gisela Ferreira</strong>, was invited to speak as part of a panel of industry leaders. The event gathered top professionals from across the PVC industry to discuss the future of compounding, production, and recycling. </p><p>Gisela contributed to a dynamic panel discussion focused on cutting-edge advancements, recycling breakthroughs, and the path to a more sustainable PVC future.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/logo-png-1-monteiro-fabrics.jpg",
